WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
Tom Bergstrom: Overall NPS came in at forty-two this quarter, up four points from last quarter.

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:09.000
Rachel Kim: What's driving the improvement, do we know?

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:13.000
Tom Bergstrom: Promoter comments consistently cite implementation speed as the strength.

00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:18.000
Nina Patel: Detractors still mention reporting flexibility as a gap, which lines up with the competitive teardown.

00:00:17.000 --> 00:00:22.000
Rachel Kim: Let's make sure product management sees both the NPS themes and the teardown findings together.
